      "mergedPostDetails": "As of ~30 minutes ago (correlated with the release of OPEN BETA `Build 1913`), icons have disappeared from Friends Locations and winglets on `Build 1867`. The issue persists with restarts, and is a new issue exclusive to `Build 1867`.\n\n`Build 1913` is unaffected, but is experiencing a different buggy behavior with lazy loading (to be reported separately).\n\nI've only redacted friends' names and custom statuses with red in the attached screenshot.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1867] All profile icons disappeared from Friend Locations",
