      "mergeID": "6aaabb3a9e29dba0f901b094",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For about a week now, the profile icon in `Build 1867` keeps resetting locally to a default icon. Live branch `Build 1903` users still see an icon on my nameplate, but sometimes mine disappears from the Quick Menu, profile and nameplate on `Build 1867` locally.\n\nI am subscribed to VRC+ and either way the profile icon was made before it became a feature available for all.\n\nI believe firmly this is a bug of backwards incompatibility created by recent server side changes, while the server still allows `Build 1867` to connect.\n\nThis is not related to: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1878-profile-icon-resets-itself-to-avatar-image-after-some-time - when people were reporting that issue, `Build 1867` was unaffected, it's only started doing this in the past week.\n\nI also noticed today updating the icon from `Build 1867` no longer updates the icon on the VRChat Home website in my profile and is no longer saved in the client.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1867] Profile icon keeps resetting itself to avatar / default locally after some time (again), cannot be updated anymore",
